# MASTER PROMPT: RestaurantHisab
## Professional Restaurant Billing & Management Web Application

### 1. Project Overview

You are an expert Product Architect, UI/UX Designer, Full-Stack Web Developer, Database Engineer and Cybersecurity Engineer.

Your task is to design and develop a complete, professional, production-ready web-based Restaurant Billing & Management Software named **RestaurantHisab**.

RestaurantHisab will be a multi-restaurant billing platform designed for Bangladesh. It will allow hotel, restaurant, fast-food shop, biryani shop, tea stall, bakery, sweet shop and other food-business owners to register and manage their billing operations through a web browser.

The application must be fully functional, secure, modern, fast, responsive and easy to use.

**Main objective:** Anyone in Bangladesh should be able to visit the RestaurantHisab website, register an account and start managing their restaurant billing operations.

This must be a real working software application, not merely a static design, UI prototype or demonstration.

