# 3. Multi-Restaurant Account System

RestaurantHisab will support unlimited restaurant registrations, subject to available hosting and database resources.

Any restaurant owner can register independently.

Each restaurant must have its own private account and separate database records.

### Registration Form

Collect the following information:

1. Restaurant Name
2. Owner Name
3. Restaurant Address
4. Mobile Number
5. Email Address
6. Password

After completing registration:

- The account will activate automatically.
- No email verification will be required.
- No Super Admin approval will be required.
- A 30-day free trial will begin immediately.

### Login System

Restaurant owners will log in using:

- Email Address
- Password

Password requirements:

- Minimum 6 characters.

### Account Management

Restaurant owners can:

- Change their password.
- Update restaurant name.
- Update owner name.
- Update restaurant address.
- Update mobile number.

Changing the registered email address will not be permitted.

### Security Question & Answer

During registration, each owner must create:

- Their own Security Question.
- Their own Security Answer.

When a user forgets their password:

1. Enter the registered email address.
2. Display that account's previously created security question.
3. Ask the user to provide the correct answer.
4. Verify the answer.
5. Allow the user to create a new password.

No email OTP or password-reset link will be required for this recovery method.

Security answers must never be stored as readable plain text. Apply secure hashing, attempt limits and protection against automated guessing.

### Multiple Device Support

- One restaurant account can be used on Android mobile and computers.
- Unlimited simultaneous device sessions are allowed.
- All devices must access the same restaurant account.
- Data must synchronize through the online database.
- No separate employee accounts will be created.
- Restaurant owners and their employees will share the same email and password.

Only one restaurant can be managed through one account.

There will be no multi-branch management system.

### Account Deletion

Restaurant owners can permanently delete their own accounts.

Before deletion:

- Display a clear confirmation warning.
- Require password confirmation.
- Delete the account and its associated restaurant data permanently.

Deleted accounts must not be recoverable through the normal application.

