# 13. Invoice Number System

Every invoice must receive an automatically generated date-based Invoice Number.

Required format:

YYYYMMDD-001

Example:

- 20261109-001
- 20261109-002
- 20261109-003

The sequence must restart at 001 for each new date, separately for each restaurant.

Invoice numbers must never accidentally duplicate.

Use an atomic database operation to generate numbers safely when multiple devices create bills simultaneously.

When an existing bill is edited, its original Invoice Number must remain unchanged.

