# 19. Data Privacy & Database Isolation

This is a multi-tenant application.

Each restaurant's information must remain completely separate.

Implement proper tenant isolation.

Requirements:

- A restaurant can only access its own billing records.
- A restaurant cannot access another restaurant's information.
- Restaurant IDs must be validated server-side.
- Users must not be able to modify another restaurant's data by changing API requests.
- Every billing record must be associated with the correct restaurant account.
- Payment transaction uniqueness must be enforced at database level.

The Super Admin may view registration and payment information as specified above, but must not have access to individual restaurant invoices or sales records.

